    "updated_at": "2023-09-10T16:44:57Z",
    "body": "Here's what I'm thinking:\r\n\r\n* We can already use `RobotState::knowsFrameTransform()` as shown [here](https://github.com/ros-planning/moveit2/blob/main/moveit_core/robot_state/src/robot_state.cpp#L1229)\r\n* So, if the link is found in the robot model, grab it directly that way; otherwise, use the TF lookup.\r\n\r\nIf this sounds good, I can work on the change.",
